t-size: 22px;">Play-to-earn gets back in the game</span></h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">If you've ever played =E2=80=9CAngry Birds=E2=
=80=9D while waiting for the bus and thought, "I should be getting paid for=
 this," boy, do we have news for you.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/=
UB+113/d2q-Vf04/MX7pb_Td6rgW6FnbQ62G1nvrW8yJSQm5JR-5BN1f4_WP2-ZW0W50kgx26lZ=
3kSW35wr1Z1VRcfWW89TSLv61-ntKW7BSMG854R1rfW7f6qWT1qgGz7W2FHk452GdkWrW26_78V=
3pHBs8W7Ry2cn1lLCp7V4wFYr73QzPTW3NXp552q4wgcN6GwcbVgrlmrW27Z1FR12BC_xW7T5j2=
w57h4ScW2CRtLG1lmldMVSyHp4130F8TW61pnv319BkzVN83bbr12SW36f5xDk3204" style=
=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"YJnzMXEw" ta=
rget=3D"_blank">MoneyTime</a>, creator of a mobile app that "turns play tim=
e into pay time," recently <a  href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB=
+113/d2q-Vf04/MX7pb_Td6rgW6FnbQ62G1nvrW8yJSQm5JR-5BN1f4_Yg2-ZW0W7Y8-PT6lZ3k=
XW7LwQt02T1T13W6WfYWG6XrXxLW3mbStt831Vh6MS6Clj8y0tkW7K6q4p74016wW4PwXM411fx=
5yW9gjCvy4_sVDHW819swr1Q637mN7FXrgyBbn8vW3kBS7s8LcdGxW2-6yd75bqfr-VZm6hY1lX=
qFGW4NX8WG3L9YP7W7k8zrX6M9zbfW2WqvdV1S6yfnW2CHCGZ7GBpJ6W3FDZZ822SQ1yW5SpvLM=
123q0VW1XfwJ43FQdj4W3l4f8m1mqFqPW2b6qlY8JNgVWW3JM3GB14HCzCN3q72bhhqw3VW47cx=
w34dVQXPVvQ7sB3GwwQVW1G0jkv3yX6dJf6txjWW04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs=
-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"QVPIspz0" target=3D"_blank">closed $3m=
</a> in seed funding. It's a play-to-earn platform =E2=80=94 a term often a=
ssociated with a controversial business model that peaked in the early 2020=
s.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">What went w=
rong?&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">=E2=80=9CAxie Infinity,=E2=80=9D a Pok=C3=A9m=
on-esque game where players battled cartoon creatures, launched in 2018 =E2=
=80=94 probably the most prominent play-to-earn app.&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">Players paid hundreds of dollars to access the game an=
d compete for brand-specific cryptocurrency.<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">It spawned an exploitative micro-industry in the Phili=
ppines, promising competitive income in the country's pandemic-ravaged econ=
omy. <br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Investors fronted access fees for players in exchange =
for as much as <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04=
/MX7pb_Td6rgW6FnbQ62G1nvrW8yJSQm5JR-5BN1f4_XH2-ZW0W6N1vHY6lZ3lQW2-4mcW7DvjR=
yW4cn4Hl6GbLSHVt39qr4nKvCkV7n9gw6GWsmSW354lrm3xDWV5W6fBRQD4gyjlMW5YTDb47GRX=
Y4W2L-lR94KKR2YW65z0N27zLN1dN3CPBJ97brTzW8smYdm8KFc4YW4sRh3P7kgKvWW2H8yPf8n=
6LPpW40rcXS7bhPQ5W7Vz-gy3mPhG_W6SHP_m5xD09TW1Yfbz-65CkBXW7jkkn96j9gVmN7TYKx=
LPFYKHW48xtwk8XJwCBW2ltMKD2Fh-7KN4Rx6BKbXQN5f31P7Ql04" style=3D"color:#1927=
33" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"gYaBMuZa" target=3D"_blank"=
>50%</a> of their earnings.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Several factors, including the model's over-r=
eliance on players' continued investment and a <a href=3D"https://media.hub=
spot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/MX7pb_Td6rgW6FnbQ62G1nvrW8yJSQm5JR-5BN1f4_=
Yz2-ZW0W8wLKSR6lZ3kyW13hcrB1DfXvYVzG8pn8w1gfvW3-b-H_2lMvqFV7Jf7J51PKSnW5PMQ=
4S9kPYl8W7bRH0V735pFCW6v6KL828tGhRW8_vmxh18T49VW7b9Vp27fqJnNW8ZvBYp6878XZN5=
rt5t6L4Rr_W5JK8Bm5JVVmbW2G6l9S7Kk2rXW2d1fWY1YqvdCW3W_KR96tgC7FW2dGSgl4bvm_t=
W5VHjvF5CC6s5N2ljC2NlWbZMN3-XbKXppqzcW5DWC_t5n_Nm-W61DJq35nKrRLN7717lh8w9wZ=
W1SwG168DBSpfM-NPt_X9Ch0W9gpXql8j91zQW5wZPRz3SWHL6N3QRCltH3c_jN39h1pShQkHyf=
85M4_Y04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=
=3D"lgh6YdaR" target=3D"_blank">$620m hack</a>, ultimately crashed Axie's t=
okens over 99%.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">What's diff=
erent now?</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">MoneyTime doesn't involve cryptocurrency, pla=
yer buy-in, or quasi-gambling. Dedicated users make $2-$5 per hour at most.=
 It's billed as a paid hobby as opposed to a meaningful income source.&nbsp=
;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Developers pay to have their games pushed to =
the platform's users =E2=80=94 and a portion of MoneyTime's revenue is dist=
ributed to users who play those games on the app. A few other key players a=
re in the space:</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1"><a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2=
q-Vf04/MX7pb_Td6rgW6FnbQ62G1nvrW8yJSQm5JR-5BN1f4_WP2-ZW0W50kgx26lZ3q3W4xdP5=
Q5LY9rHN5xrQs0GLNjzW63cS8b6k8SFRW5nDSt17T22pDW3mxRzt5Nl-YwW6B_4l8302SYjW8ZN=
QW37N3jHhW7l5mkZ6ND7C4N4yxfRmLKr6bW952jzR8plfvDW164xSy4FfgWmW5Hkwp-5WY2j2W2=
kxw_96-vcFbW5L5D__9fYXmMW78-9NL5VK7N6W1NmSzL3WzX5kf5HkJwF04" style=3D"color=
:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"4VVb50bN" target=3D"_=
blank">Mistplay</a> surpassed 10m downloads, offering gift cards in exchang=
e for game time. <br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1"><a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2=
q-Vf04/MX7pb_Td6rgW6FnbQ62G1nvrW8yJSQm5JR-5BN1f4_WP2-ZW0W50kgx26lZ3lVW78TKD=
01dxRjXW3fy75d4cvj91W3QCx8N1-WHRsW5GFZy36-x4jnW7NnXTy42Z2NdN9ccJ7CBdYgmW9bC=
87_8YlvYNW5gcF4J4fMHS5W6cy5My4knJ27W1Qb33w4lMjPlW4vRtgy8GVdj-W2XWCX56fJgLKW=
8zydVx8jpjYDW2zJ_-86_hL4VW4yW1RW6Ttbq6W81pgLH9gK8X6f2jV1M404" style=3D"colo=
r:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"OgXiWVlJ" target=3D"=
_blank">Swagbucks</a> gives cash rewards for activities beyond gaming, such=
 as taking surveys and watching videos. <br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1"><a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2=
q-Vf04/MX7pb_Td6rgW6FnbQ62G1nvrW8yJSQm5JR-5BN1f4_X42-ZW0W5BW0B06lZ3l4W5N0BZ=
W3tWDYWW94qqhM2kBQpSW3RQ48F1K65FkW8BZbxp6fPV2BW76qCwV44PkhzW2xvPKT4NlWHwVpV=
SkM1r2-0HN4Skw1vWxqLMW52DZ1c6Rmx0mW4GD5Yj6qYk2wW5_sgVN2XRwQVW97tJ1k47Q3ZPVy=
zYqm1tfJzqW1rnvHF8RbWJcN4bF5xQ4m0HjW8msxZ22zzXd2W2Mk6qb58gTSNW74dDC07Ql3XTf=
8T4PFR04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=
=3D"MrgjXDN4" target=3D"_blank">JustPlay</a> lets you cash out or donate th=
e money you earn from playing games.</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Of course, any tech promising passive income =
through a mobile app raises concerns about data privacy and potential scams=
. And people familiar with stories like Axie Infinity's might have reservat=
ions about anything labeled "play-to-earn."</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">But MoneyTime seems pretty frank about its in=
tentions. It offers developers exposure and gives users a couple of extra b=
ucks here and there =E2=80=94 a tough mission for people to exploit.<br><br=
></p>
